"""Build PrimaCura held-out test set v1 (written 2026-10-05).

Rules followed while writing these:
* None of the queries reuse wording from the Oct 4 evaluation sheet, from the
  dataset's `symptoms` column, or from the keyword regexes in pchCore.py.
* Mix of styles: plain description, slang, speech-to-text style (lowercase,
  no punctuation, fillers), typos, minimal detail, negations/distractors.
* Expected_Age_Band is only set where the protocol differs by age
  (Cardiac Arrest, Choking); "any" elsewhere.
* Follow_Up_Replies holds scripted user replies for multi-turn cases,
  separated by " || ". The runner sends them in order when the app asks.

Labels should be reviewed by a clinician before this set is used to sign off a
release.
"""
